WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.801 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Republicans have promised
to pass their tax plan

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:02.535 size:84% position:42% line:92%
by the end of the year,

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:03.770 align:start size:94% position:6%
which has Capitol Hill
scrambling.

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:06.106
To find out a little bit more
about how things are going

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:08.742 align:start size:94% position:6%
in Washington, we've come up
with a new segment called

00:00:08.742 --> 00:00:10.210 size:81% position:41% line:92%
"Just the Tax, Ma'am."

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:13.546 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:16.583 align:start size:94% position:6%
Paul Ryan continues
to push hard for tax reform,

00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:18.251 align:start size:94% position:6%
though it's hard
to push anything when

00:00:18.251 --> 00:00:19.886 size:84% position:42% line:92%
you don't have a spine.

00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:21.488 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.488 --> 00:00:23.390 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Leave em' alone!

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:26.493 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Excuse me?
-Leave em' alone!

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:29.529 align:start size:94% position:6%
Haven't we made fun
of Paul Ryan enough?

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:31.331 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, you know,
he is a public figure,

00:00:31.331 --> 00:00:33.666 align:start size:94% position:6%
so I think it's okay
to make jokes about him.

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:35.568 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Leave em' alone.

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:39.172 align:start size:94% position:6%
Poor guy, day in and day out,
just trying his best.

00:00:39.172 --> 00:00:40.840 size:88% position:44%
The last thing he needs
after a long day at work

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:45.278
is to turn on the TV and see
you ripping him a new one.

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:47.213 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Leave em' alone!

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:47.747 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:49.949 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm sorry, are you
a Paul Ryan supporter?

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:52.886
-If I'm a supporter of anything,
it's compassion.

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:57.123 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's human decency,
not snide little jokes.

00:00:57.123 --> 00:01:01.127 align:start size:94% position:6%
If you have to make fun
of somebody, make fun of me!

00:01:01.127 --> 00:01:03.129 line:92%
-Yeah, I don't even know you,

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:04.431 line:92%
so why would I make fun of you?

00:01:04.431 --> 00:01:07.367
-Well, you could make fun of
the fact that my toenails grow

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:10.703 align:start size:94% position:6%
so fast that I have
to clip them twice a day!

00:01:10.703 --> 00:01:11.237 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.237 --> 00:01:12.472 size:84% position:42%
-Not really something
you should tell people.

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:15.241
You know, I just usually tell
jokes about people who are

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:17.010 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the news,
people like Paul Ryan.

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:20.313 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, sure,
make fun of Paul Ryan.

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:20.880 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Have your fun.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:23.383
Go ahead and say he looks
like a lipless Dracula

00:01:23.383 --> 00:01:24.684 size:84% position:42% line:92%
who just shed his skin.

00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:27.887 line:92%
-Whoa, that's really harsh, man.

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:30.190 line:92%
-I know, so leave em' alone!

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:32.926
-You know, I think I would just
love to get back to my jokes.

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:35.962 size:84% position:42%
-Oh well, you know what
you'd love, a laugh.

00:01:35.962 --> 00:01:36.629 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And how about this?

00:01:36.629 --> 00:01:39.866
You could make fun of the fact
that I dress my dog up as Santa

00:01:39.866 --> 00:01:40.800 size:84% position:42% line:92%
and my cat up as Jesus,

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:44.370 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I make them fight about
the true meaning of Christmas!

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:45.338 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.338 --> 00:01:48.174
Or, you could make fun of
the fact that sometimes

00:01:48.174 --> 00:01:49.576 line:92%
I whisper things to Superman

00:01:49.576 --> 00:01:51.878 align:start size:94% position:6%
because I figure
with his super-hearing,

00:01:51.878 --> 00:01:53.646 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
he can hear me.

00:01:53.646 --> 00:01:56.416 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I would really rather
just make fun of Paul Ryan.

00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:58.918
-[ Whispering ] Leave em' alone.
-What?

00:01:58.918 --> 00:01:59.752 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I can't hear you.

00:01:59.752 --> 00:02:02.889 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I was talking
to Superman!

00:02:02.889 --> 00:02:05.358 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Sir, why don't you
please sit down

00:02:05.358 --> 00:02:06.593 line:92%
so we can continue the show?

00:02:06.593 --> 00:02:10.396 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Fine, go ahead and get back
to your Paul Ryan jokes.

00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:12.265 line:92%
You know what I'd say to that?

00:02:12.265 --> 00:02:14.367 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm guessing you'd say,
"Leave em' alone."

00:02:14.367 --> 00:02:16.336 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Leave em' alone!

00:02:16.336 --> 00:02:19.439 align:start size:94% position:6%
If you need to make fun
of somebody, make fun of me!

00:02:19.439 --> 00:02:21.407 align:start size:94% position:6%
Make fun of the fact
that when I got married,

00:02:21.407 --> 00:02:25.812 align:start size:94% position:6%
I took my wife's name --
her first name!

00:02:25.812 --> 00:02:30.517 size:75% position:38%
So now my legal name
is Beverly Beverly.

00:02:30.517 --> 00:02:32.218 line:92%
-What was your name before that?

00:02:32.218 --> 00:02:35.421 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Susan Beverly.
-Okay.

00:02:35.421 --> 00:02:36.289 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Wow.

00:02:36.289 --> 00:02:38.091 line:92%
-Need some more material?

00:02:38.091 --> 00:02:40.527 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No.
-Well too bad, so sad.

00:02:40.527 --> 00:02:42.862 align:start size:94% position:6%
Leave em' alone,
because I got more.

00:02:42.862 --> 00:02:45.231 align:start size:94% position:6%
You could make fun of the fact
that I pee a little bit

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:49.702 align:start size:94% position:6%
every time I cry, and I cry
a lot every time I pee!

00:02:49.702 --> 00:02:50.436 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.436 --> 00:02:53.406
Or, you could make fun of
the fact that the reason the --

00:02:53.406 --> 00:02:55.975 align:start size:94% position:6%
they announced the walkway is
about to end is because

00:02:55.975 --> 00:02:58.978 align:start size:94% position:6%
every time I step on one
I scream, "Dear God,

00:02:58.978 --> 00:03:00.046 size:81% position:41% line:92%
when is this ending?!"

00:03:00.046 --> 00:03:01.014 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:03:01.014 --> 00:03:02.382 line:92%
Or you can make fun of the fact

00:03:02.382 --> 00:03:04.751 line:92%
that my nickname is Miniballs!

00:03:04.751 --> 00:03:06.553 line:92%
But it's not what you think.

00:03:06.553 --> 00:03:09.789 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's because I have
tiny testicles!

00:03:09.789 --> 00:03:10.456 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.456 --> 00:03:13.293
Or you could make fun of the
fact that I lost my virginity

00:03:13.293 --> 00:03:16.663
when I was 24,
and it came back when I was 31.

00:03:16.663 --> 00:03:19.699
-Alright, that's enough.
You can just sit down, sir.

00:03:19.699 --> 00:03:21.634 size:75% position:38%
-[ Tearfully ] Fine,
I'll sit back down.

00:03:21.634 --> 00:03:23.903 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, no, I didn't mean
to upset you.

00:03:23.903 --> 00:03:25.872 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, I'm not upset,
I'm just peeing.

00:03:25.872 --> 00:03:27.740 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Alright, that's enough!

